<title>USA: CCC seeks U.S. wheat for donation to Bangladesh.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks U.S. wheat for donation to Bangladesh.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it seeks a total of 10,530 tonnes U.S. hard red wheat under its export program to Bangladesh.</p>
<p>The wheat was divided into two offers. One was for 5,870 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat and the other offer was for 4,660 tonnes HRW or hard red spring wheat.</p>
<p>Shipment period for both was slated for March 15-April 10.</p>
<p>Offers were due on February 26.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
